<title>USA: Ingersoll-Rand gets $40 mln India contract.</title>
<headline>Ingersoll-Rand gets $40 mln India contract.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ingersoll-Rand Co said Monday that it has received a $40 milion contract to supply air compressors and related equipment to India's Oil &amp; Natural Gas Corp Ltd.</p>
<p>Ingersoll-Rand said it will deliver six of its Centac air compressors and six secondary booster compressors made by Dresser-Rand, its joint venture with Dresser Industries Inc, for use at an oil recovery plant being built in Santhal, India.</p>
</text>
